        "length_m": 1.6787,
        "note": "deforming spine chain child of pelvis; bone +Z = belly; the mesh is one continuous skin with the torso"
      },
      "texture_sources": {
        "skin_detail": "Codex image_gen reptile_skin_gen_v1 + snake_scales_gen_v2 (AI-generated; provenance sidecars in art/team/units_opus55/textures/snakeman_v01/gen), tint-neutral detail/height",
        "vest_weave": "Poly Haven fabric_pattern_07, CC0 1.0 (https://polyhaven.com/a/fabric_pattern_07)",
        "wounds_and_drips": "Codex image_gen wound_decals_gen_v1 + blood_runs_gen_v1 (AI-generated)",
        "procedural": "palette colours, masks, scutes, utility maps"
      },
      "albedo_policy": "authored at the SNAKEMAN.PCK colours, no per-asset darkening or brightening (user decision 2026-10-02); judge hue, saturation and contrast in the lab",
      "source_assumptions": [
        "Proportions from UP030 row measurements (crown at standHeight 18 = 1.837 m); battlescape PCK is the silhouette and colour authority.",
        "Serpent body read from the PCK body frames 16-23: the column descends forward from the belt, folds in a U-bend at the front (pale scutes outside) and runs straight back under the torso on the floor to a tapering tail; opus-v2: the floor run is shortened so the standing tail tip lies ~0.55 m behind the tile centre, as the side frames 17 / 21 read (opus-v1 0.78 m).",
        "Colours: gold skin at the PCK hue (arms mean #a65d1d) authored ~10 % more saturated (the unit lab read the first bake 0.87x as saturated under its sky ambient; no brightness change), pale grey-mauve scutes, grey-mauve shoulder shells with a lavender rim (UP030), lavender ribbed back plate and belt, orange vest (UP030; the sprite chest reads orange).",
        "Shoulder shells, back lames and belt are rigid gear; the vest is a body-derived garment with the skin weights.",
        "Head: helmet-like reptilian skull with a sagittal crest, small deep-set eyes, a wide open mouth with fangs and the pale tongue hanging over the lower lip (UP030); no visible neck.",
        "Hands: three clawed fingers and a thumb (UP030).",
        "Idle and Hit are authored (routine 6 has no idle or hit frames); the walk follows the sprite bob / surge.",
        "Armed: rarm1H 99-106 forearm-forward waist hold in IdleArmed / WalkArmed; Attack raises it to a shoulder aim.",
        "Death: a snappy directional recoil (user 2026-10-02) replaces the 96-97 crumple; the ragdoll takes over at 0.133 s and the whole-body twist turns him toward the shooter as he falls; the fallback DeathBaked falls backward.",
        "Textures (source priority 2026-10-02): skin detail from Codex image_gen swatches (pebbles, snake scales) used tint-neutral over the sprite palette; vest weave relief from Poly Haven fabric_pattern_07 (CC0); wound decals and drip runs from Codex image_gen; floor splatter / pool / spray shared with the Sectoid sets."
      ],
